    "solution": "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n\ndays = [\"Mon\", \"Tue\", \"Wed\", \"Thu\", \"Fri\"]\nminutes = [10, 15, 20, 15, 25]\nplt.figure(figsize=(6, 4))\nplt.plot(days, minutes, marker=\"o\")\nplt.title(\"Reading time\")\nplt.xlabel(\"Day\")\nplt.ylabel(\"Minutes\")\nplt.ylim(bottom=0)\nplt.tight_layout()\nplt.show()\nprint(\"첫날 대비 변화(분):\", minutes[-1] - minutes[0])",
