    "solution": "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n\nminutes = [15, 25, 35, 45]\nscores = [50, 65, 60, 85]\nplt.figure(figsize=(6, 4))\nplt.scatter(minutes, scores)\nplt.title(\"Practice and quiz\")\nplt.xlabel(\"Study (minutes)\")\nplt.ylabel(\"Quiz score (points)\")\nplt.xlim(left=0)\nplt.ylim(0, 100)\nplt.tight_layout()\nplt.show()\nprint(\"관측 수:\", len(minutes))",
